      "value": "Open the social tab, and find the person from there.  It is less ideal, but it is a work around.\n\nAs someone who likes size difference I would hate this meme to also ruin the main reason I came to VRchat.\n\nI hate the meme, and wish it would die, it's killing VRchat.",
