  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-01-11T03:54:26.562Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There's an epidemic as I'm sure everybody is aware of, where the Ugandan Knuckles will run around making noise and just generally being racist, ignorant bigots.\n\nWhat makes this especially annoying is that the people who perpetuate this awful meme are TINY.\n\nYou can't realistically stop what you're doing, open your quick menu and then click on them and THEN click report/block/mute.\n\nIt's becoming a real hassle trying to filter out the cacophony that many users seem to subject the room (world) to.\n\nI'm also going to say that it's not just these knuckles characters but just anyone who wants to troll and be a royal nuisance but especially small characters are nigh impossible to catch.",
